.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH RMDIR 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
rmdir \- Remove the DIRECTORY(ies), if they are empty.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrmdir\fR [OPTION]... DIRECTORY...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Remove the DIRECTORY(ies), if they are empty.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-ignore\-fail\-on\-non\-empty\fR
ignore each failure that is solely because a directory is non\-empty
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-parents\fR
remove DIRECTORY and its ancestors; e.g., \*(Aqrmdir \-p a/b/c\*(Aq is similar to rmdir a/b/c a/b a
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
output a diagnostic for every directory processed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIdirs\fR>

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
